    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "The area $A$ of the annulus formed by two concentric circles of radii $R$ and $r$ is given by the formula $A=\\pi(R^2-r^2)$, where $R>r$. Use this formula to find the area, correct to the nearest cm², of the annulus formed by two concentric circles of radii:",
